al package-of-practices guidance) should be directed to IISR's SMS/photo-based farmer helpline rather than relying solely on static documents, since this channel provides current, personalized diagnosis.\n- Given IISR's active 2024 focus on biological control training for borers and white grubs, any advisory content on these two pests (see the Pest Management document) should be treated as current best practice, not superseded guidance — the institute's own 2024 programming reinforces rather than revises the 2017 bulletin's biological-control recommendations for these specific pests.\n\n# CONVERSATION MEMORY (recent turns, for context)\nFarmer: ನನ್ನ ಬೆಳೆ ಹೇಗಿದೆ?\nGage (earlier, shortened): **Observation** - ಸಮಯ: 2026‑07‑26 16:40 UTC (node demo‑node‑1) - ತಾಪಮಾನ: 23.0 °C (ಬದಲಾವಣೆಯಾಗಿಲ್ಲ) - ಆರ್ದ್ರತೆ: 64.2 % (ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಇಳಿದಿದೆ) - ಮಣ್ಣಿನ ತೇವಾಂಶ: 0.0 % (ವಾಲ್ಯೂಮೆಟ್ರಿಕ್) – ಹಿಂದಿನ ಮಾಪನದಿಂದ 49 % ಕುಸಿತ (49 % → 0 %) - ಸಕ್ರಿಯ ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ: ...\nFarmer: ನನ್ನ ಬೆಳೆ ಹೇಗಿದೆ?\nGage (earlier, shortened): **Observation** - ಸಮಯ: 2026‑07‑26 16:40 UTC (node demo‑node‑1) - ತಾಪಮಾನ: 23.0 °C (ಬದಲಾವಣೆ ಇಲ್ಲ) - ಆರ್ದ್ರತೆ: 64.2 % (ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಇಳಿದಿದೆ) - ಮಣ್ಣಿನ ತೇವಾಂಶ: 0.0 % (ವಾಲ್ಯೂಮೆಟ್ರಿಕ್) – ಹಿಂದಿನ ಮಾಪನದಿಂದ 49 % ಕುಸಿತ (49 % → 0 %) - ಸಕ್ರಿಯ ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ: **Low ...\nFarmer: ನನ್ನ ಬೆಳೆ ಹೇಗಿದೆ?\nGage (earlier, shortened): **Observation** - Vision: ಚಿತ್ರವನ್ನು ಬ್ರೌನ್ ಸ್ಪಾಟ್ (brown spot) ಎಂದು 95% ವಿಶ್ವಾಸದೊಂದಿಗೆ ವರ್ಗೀಕರಿಸಲಾಗಿದೆ. - Temperature: 25.0 °C - Humidity: 55.0 % - Soil moisture: 40.0 % - Active alerts: - [warning] High humidity 88 % (ರೋಗದ ಅಪಾಯ) - ...\n\n# USER QUESTION\nNodi anna, sugarcane borer training IISR yavaga nadesidru confirm madi.", "farmer": "Nodi anna, sugarcane borer training IISR yavaga nadesidru confirm madi."}, "retrieval_methods": {"original": "Nodi anna, sugarcane borer training IISR yavaga nadesidru confirm madi.", "sarvam": "Sir, please confirm the date of conducting the Sugarcane Borer Training by IIRSAR.", "groq": "When did IISR conduct sugarcane borer training? confirm dates."}, "retrieval_b