unts department and, if needed, the state cane commissioner to invoke the statutory interest liability provisions.  \n  2. If you are unsure whether a SAP applies in Karnataka, consult the Karnataka State Agricultural Marketing Board or a local KVK for clarification.", "fact_check": "checked", "fact_check_seconds": 1.56, "groq_calls": [{"purpose": "answer", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "prompt_tokens": 1867, "completion_tokens": 585, "seconds": 2.83, "status": "ok", "seq": 22}, {"purpose": "fact_check", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "prompt_tokens": 1188, "completion_tokens": 369, "seconds": 1.56, "status": "ok", "seq": 23}]}
