ated Management of White Grubs Infesting Sugarcane,\" at the same Biological Control Centre.\n  - Training program on \"Biological Control of Pests in Sugarcane,\" organized by the ICAR-IISR Biological Control Centre, Pravaranagar.\n  - Launch of \"Parthenium Awareness Week\" (16–22 August 2024) by ICAR-IISR — a weed-management/invasive-species public awareness initiative.\n\n- Farmers or advisory-system builders seeking real-time, query-specific sugarcane troubleshooting (as opposed to general package-of-practices guidance) should be directed to IISR's SMS/photo-based farmer helpline rather than relying solely on static documents, since this channel provides current, personalized diagnosis.\n- Given IISR's active 2024 focus on biological control training for borers and white grubs, any advisory content on these two pests (see the Pest Management document) should be treated as current best practice, not superseded guidance — the institute's own 2024 programming reinforces rather than revises the 2017 bulletin's biological-control recommendations for these specific pests.", "farmer": "Nodi anna, sugarcane borer training IISR yavaga nadesidru confirm madi."}, "retrieval_methods": {"original": "Nodi anna, sugarcane borer training IISR yavaga nadesidru confirm madi.", "sarvam": "Sir, please confirm the date of conducting the Sugarcane Borer Training by IIRSAR.", "groq": "When did IISR conduct sugarcane borer training? confirm dates."}, "retrieval_best_by_method": {"original": 0.8314, "sarvam": 0.8641, "groq": 0.8592}, "retrieved": [{"source": "pests/02_iisr_current_helpline_and_2024_2025_activities.md", "section": "ICAR-IISR Current Farmer Helpline and 2024–2025 Institutional Activities — Key Facts", "score": 0.8619, "via": "sarvam"}, {"source": "pests/02_iisr_current_helpline_and_2024_2025_activities.md", "section": "ICAR-IISR Current Farmer Helpline and 2024–2025 Institutional Activities — Main Information", "score": 0.8617, "via": "sarvam"}, {"source": "pests/02_iisr_current_helpline_and_2024_2025_activities.md", "section": "ICAR-IISR Current Farmer Helpline and 2024–2025 Institutional Activities — Main Information", "score": 0.8641, "via": "sarvam"}, {"source": "pests/02_iisr_current_helpline_and_2024_2025_activities.md", "section": "ICAR-IISR Current Farmer Helpline and 2024–2025 Institutional Activities — Important Recommendations", "score": 0.8559, "via": "sarvam"}], "raw_answer": "Anna swamy, mekanizm indha kelida mattu biologicial controls ge specifically train maadirodu Sir -- ee information correct agide.", "claims": ["unsupported: Training on mechanisms and biological controls was specifically conducted", "unsupported: The information provided is correct"], "unsupported": ["unsupported: Training on mechanisms and biological controls was specifically conducted", "unsupported: The information provided is correct"], "final_answer": "Please double-check before acting: \"Training on mechanisms and biological controls was specifically conducted\" (not in Gage's sources); \"The information provided is correct\" (not in Gage's sources).\n\nAnna swamy, mekanizm indha kelida mattu biologicial controls ge specifically train maadirodu Sir -- ee information correct agide.", "fact_check": "checked", "fact_check_seconds": 1.02, "groq_calls": [{"purpose": "rewrite", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "prompt_tokens": 206, "completion_tokens": 42, "seconds": 0.22, "status": "ok", "seq": 35}, {"purpose": "fact_check", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "prompt_tokens": 799, "completion_tokens": 179, "seconds": 1.02, "status": "ok", "seq": 36}]}
