2026-10-05 13:44:49,720 gage.orchestrator INFO answer trace {"farm": 1, "provider": "sarvam_finetuned", "answer_seconds": 12.36, "language": "kn", "question": "VKSA ಅಂತ ಒಂದು programme ಇದೆ ಅಂತ ಕೇಳಿದ್ದೀನಿ, ನಮ್ಮ ಕರ್ನಾಟಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂತಾ?", "retrieval_queries": ["VKSA ಅಂತ ಒಂದು programme ಇದೆ ಅಂತ ಕೇಳಿದ್ದೀನಿ, ನಮ್ಮ ಕರ್ನಾಟಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂತಾ?", "I have heard that there is a programme called VKSA in our Karnataka.", "VKSA programme Karnataka availability?"], "model_input": {"context": "Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan (VKSA-2025) is a current, active ICAR/Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare nationwide campaign (29 May – 12 June 2025) that deployed roughly 2,000 outreach teams across 2,170 locations in 700+ districts, including participation from 731 Krishi Vigyan Kendras (KVKs), to connect over 1.5 crore farmers directly with agricultural scientists. Karnataka was an explicit part of this campaign, with the state launch held at ICAR-IIHR (Indian Institute of Horticultural Research), Bengaluru.\n\n- Campaign window: 29 May – 12 June 2025 (first 2025 edition; VKSA is designed to run twice per year).\n- Scale: ~2,000 teams, 2,170 locations, 700+ districts, 731 KVKs, targeting over 1.5 crore farmers nationally.\n- Karnataka state launch: 8 June 2025, at ICAR-IIHR, Bengaluru.\n\n- Given VKSA operates through the existing KVK network (731 KVKs nationwide) and is designed to run twice yearly, any Karnataka sugarcane farmer advisory tool should treat VKSA outreach windows as a channel for surfacing current, hyper-local advisory content (soil health, crop-specific guidance) rather than a static knowledge source — the campaign itself generates farmer feedback and localized recommendations that are not centrally published as a single document.\n- Because VKSA explicitly emphasizes soil health dissemination, this campaign should be cross-referenced with the Soil Health Card scheme (see the Soil Health document) as a complementary current outreach mechanism, not a standalone data source.\n\n- For a genuinely current, sugarcane-specific KVK advisory, the recommended next step is to directly contact the relevant Karnataka KVK (e.g., KVK Mandya, given the AICRP-Sugarcane centre is located at V.C. Farm, Mandya) for their most recent VKSA-linked or season-specific sugarcane advisory material, since this was not retrievable as a standalone published document in this research pass.", "farmer": "VKSA ಅಂತ ಒಂದು programme ಇದೆ ಅಂತ ಕೇಳಿದ್ದೀನಿ, ನಮ್ಮ ಕರ್ನಾಟಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂತಾ?"}, "retrieval_methods": {"original": "VKSA ಅಂತ ಒಂದು programme ಇದೆ ಅಂತ ಕೇಳಿದ್ದೀನಿ, ನಮ್ಮ ಕರ್ನಾಟಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂತಾ?", "sarvam": "I have heard that there is a programme called VKSA in our Karnataka.", "groq": "VKSA programme Karnataka availability?"}, "retrieval_best_by_method": {"original": 0.8533, "sarvam": 0.8531, "groq": 0.8838}, "retrieved": [{"source": "government_schemes/02_viksit_krishi_sankalp_abhiyan_vksa_2025.md", "section": "Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan (VKSA-2025): Current National Farmer-Scientist Outreach Campaign — Summary", "score": 0.8838, "via": "groq"}, {"source": "government_schemes/02_viksit_krishi_sankalp_abhiyan_vksa_2025.md", "section": "Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan (VKSA-2025): Current National Farmer-Scientist Outreach Campaign — Key Facts", "score": 0.8812, "via": "groq"}, {"source": "government_schemes/02_viksit_krishi_sankalp_abhiyan_vksa_2025.md", "section": "Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan (VKSA-2025): Current National Farmer-Scientist Outreach Campaign — Important Recommendations", "score": 0.8714, "via": "groq"}, {"source": "government_schemes/02_viksit_krishi_sankalp_abhiyan_vksa_2025.md", "section": "Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan (VKSA-2025): Current National Farmer-Scientist Outreach Campaign — Important Recommendations", "score": 0.8686, "via": "groq"}], "raw_answer": "ಹೌದು, VKSA ಅಂದ್ರೆ Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan, ಇದು ಪ್ರತಿ ಎರಡು ವರ್ಷಕ್ಕೊಮ್ಮೆ ನಡೆಯುತ್ತೆ, 2025 ರಲ್ಲಿ nationwide launch ಆಯ್ತು, ಮತ್ತು Karnataka ಕೂಡ ಈ campaign ನ ಒಂದು ಭಾಗ ಆಗಿತ್ತು.", "claims": ["supported: VKSA is Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan", "contradicted: VKSA runs every two years", "supported: VKSA had a nationwide launch in 2025", "supported: Karnataka was part of the VKSA campaign"], "unsupported": ["contradicted: VKSA runs every two years"], "final_answer": "ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು ಮುಂದುವರಿಯುವ ಮೊದಲು ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಿ: \"VKSA runs every two years\" (Gage ಮಾಹಿತಿ ದಾಖಲೆಗಳಿಗೆ ವಿರುದ್ಧವಾಗಿದೆ).\n\nಹೌದು, VKSA ಅಂದ್ರೆ Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan, ಇದು ಪ್ರತಿ ಎರಡು ವರ್ಷಕ್ಕೊಮ್ಮೆ ನಡೆಯುತ್ತೆ, 2025 ರಲ್ಲಿ nationwide launch ಆಯ್ತು, ಮತ್ತು Karnataka ಕೂಡ ಈ campaign ನ ಒಂದು ಭಾಗ ಆಗಿತ್ತು.", "fact_check": "checked", "fact_check_seconds": 1.16, "groq_calls": [{"purpose": "rewrite", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "prompt_tokens": 204, "completion_tokens": 29, "seconds": 0.8, "status": "ok", "seq": 43}, {"purpose": "fact_check", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "prompt_tokens": 832, "completion_tokens": 292, "seconds": 1.16, "status": "ok", "seq": 44}]}
